        "created_at": "2017-07-17T23:37:19.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>So... say you got a Slow, Range 0 from Presence power. Yet during Ravage, a Blight gets placed down where you were going to use it. You don't have any presence there anymore. Does that power no longer work there (and could you, theoretically, just use it somewhere else you have presence if you wanted to?</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>I know its somewhat silly, because you can see the blight coming ahead of time, but I'm wondering for if you can play it anyways, and use it after the blight to do ... well whatever it is (my wife was playing as Shadows and was going to move some stuff out of one land so we could deal with it next turn, but she made the call that it wouldn't work)</p>",
        "post_number": 1,
        "post_type": 1,
