        "cooked": "<p>Oh. and loving the game. We lost a BUNCH in a row, should have won that first \"progression\" game, but forgot to be taking fear for destroying towns/cities, but finally won tonight with Shadows and Thunderspeaker. Ohhhh boy Thunderspeaker is a LOT of fun, running around the board with a couple dozen dahan and murderizing colonists.</p>",
