        "raw": "<p>For targetting, you can only use presence (and sacred sites) that is on the map at the time you are activating the power. So if your presence gets destroyed during Ravage, you can&#39;t use it to target slow powers.</p><p>Glad you&#39;re having fun. Shadows and Thunderspeaker is a fun combination, particularly with Shadows&#39; ability to protect the Dahan (thus Thunderspeaker&#39;s presence) during ravage.</p>",
